j I love my girl
she lookin' good j


00:07:23.652 --> 00:07:25.438
j come on j


00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.895
j one more... j


00:08:07.779 --> 00:08:09.360
Easy, easy, easy.


00:08:09.531 --> 00:08:11.487
Good boy. Come on. Turn.


00:08:12.534 --> 00:08:14.650
Hold, son. Hold, son.


00:08:21.793 --> 00:08:23.954
Come on, son. That's it.


