00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:01.866
A small knife.


00:11:02.036 --> 00:11:03.446
No, it's Damascus steel.


00:11:03.621 --> 00:11:04.906
It's a letter opener I made


00:11:05.081 --> 00:11:07.322
