00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.735
Even before your age.


00:12:27.914 --> 00:12:29.745
Did you like it?


00:12:29.916 --> 00:12:32.498
Well, I had some
of the best friends


00:12:32.669 --> 00:12:34.284
